---
// No props, no slots — static hero section.
---

<section class="hero" id="hero">
	<div class="hero-bg"></div>
	<div class="hero-grid"></div>
	<div class="hero-content">
		<div class="hero-eyebrow">Diagrama cronológico · 1910–2024</div>
		<div class="hero-pretitle">Poética de la</div>

		<div class="hero-letters" role="img" aria-label="Fragmentación">
			<div class="hero-letters-row">
				<span class="ltr ltr-F">F</span>
				<span class="ltr ltr-R">R</span>
				<span class="ltr ltr-A">A</span>
				<span class="ltr ltr-G">G</span>
				<span class="ltr ltr-M">M</span>
				<span class="ltr ltr-E">E</span>
			</div>
			<div class="hero-letters-row">
				<span class="ltr ltr-DOT">·</span>
				<span class="ltr ltr-N">N</span>
				<span class="ltr ltr-T">T</span>
				<span class="ltr ltr-A2">A</span>
				<span class="ltr ltr-CI">CI</span>
				<span class="ltr ltr-ON">ÓN</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<p class="hero-sub">
			De las vanguardias europeas al posmodernismo latinoamericano y la
			música experimental contemporánea
		</p>
		<a href="#timeline" class="hero-cta">
			Explorar la línea de tiempo
			<span class="arrow">↓</span>
		</a>
	</div>
	<div class="hero-era-labels">
		<div class="era-label"><strong>1910s–40s</strong>Vanguardias</div>
		<div class="era-label"><strong>1950s–70s</strong>Neoav. & Boom</div>
		<div class="era-label"><strong>1980s–90s</strong>Posmodernismo</div>
		<div class="era-label"><strong>2000s–hoy</strong>Digital & Experimental</div>
	</div>
</section>
